# Files agents should NOT read automatically. Survey material lives in the NETS workspace,
# outside this repository; these patterns are a second line of defence if any of it is
# ever placed here. (Claude Code honours .claudeignore; other agents: treat this as the
# do-not-read list.)

*.pdf
*.txt
*.docx
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xml
*.rds
*.rda
*.RData
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.sqlite

workspace/
sources/
local/
context/
evidence/
outputs/

# Inside a NETS workspace (outside this repo), agents never read sources/ or local/;
# see AGENT-READ-POLICY.md in each survey folder.
